                                <li><strong>Get Your Prescription</strong> - Receive your medical cannabis prescription</li>
                                <li><strong>Upload Section 21</strong> - Submit your authorization letter for verification</li>
                                <li><strong>Shop Medical Products</strong> - Access pharmaceutical-grade cannabis products</li>
                            </ol>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
